  "title": "Auntie&#39;s Buttermilk Cake",
  "description": "I got this recipe, as well as so many others, from my favorite aunt. She loved to bake--she used to say it was her &#34;therapy,&#34; and I feel the same way!",
  "authors": [
    "Jeannette Gartner"
  ],
